                            <h5>About the Author</h5>
<p>Robert S. Kaplan was president and CEO of the Federal Reserve Bank of Dallas, 2015&ndash;21.</p>

<div class="separator"></div>
<p>The views expressed are my own and do not necessarily reflect official positions of the Federal Reserve System.</p>

